      \u0430\u0442\u0430\u043A\u0430\u043C."
    descEn: The Sphere gains Phase, adding penetration to its attacks.
    detailsRu:
    detailsEn:
  - section: evolutions
    id: sphere-final:void:void_execution:2
    group: sphere-finals
    nameRu: "\u041F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0442\u043D\u0430\u044F \xB7 \u042D\u043A\u0437\u0435\u043A\u0443\u0446\u0438\u044F
