      \u0443\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044F \u0437\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442\u0443
      \u0432 \u0440\u0435\u0437\u043E\u043D\u0430\u043D\u0441\u0435."
    descEn: A blocked hit restores one shield charge, keeping the defense in resonance.
    detailsRu:
    detailsEn:
  - section: evolutions
    id: ability-evolution:teleport_echo_jump
    group: ability-evolutions
